  "final_resolution": "The single most important trade-off in this decision is the balance between initial cost and long-term flexibility and customization versus immediate cost savings and operational efficiency.\n\nBased on the arguments presented, I recommend **BUY**. While building a custom CRM in-house offers long-term flexibility and a better fit for specific operational needs, the initial high cost and the time required to develop and maintain such a system make it less attractive compared to the lower upfront costs and faster deployment of a SaaS CRM. For a company with specific, but not overly complex, requirements, the SaaS CRM provides a more efficient and cost-effective solution.",
